      "description": "Flat module structure and disabled Open link; no raised card.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-row\"><div><h2>Pantalla<span class=\"ds-origin\">Argus</span></h2><p>Capturas, OCR, búsqueda visual, importaciones y línea de tiempo.</p></div><a class=\"ds-open\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\">Abrir</a></article>",
